      <dico>Lessing</dico>
      <unicode>ᠲᠠᠯᠠᠷᠬᠠᠬᠣ</unicode>
      <uighur>talarqaqu</uighur>
      <cyrillic>талархах</cyrillic>
      <transcript>TALARXA-</transcript>
      <definition>v. i. To be thankful or grateful; to show friendliness or respect; to appreciate.</definition>
      <page>772</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠠᠴᠢ ᠳ᠋‍‍ᠤ‍ᠷ ᠲᠠᠯᠠᠷᠬᠠᠬᠣ</unicode>
          <transcript>aci dur --xu</transcript>
          <definition> To thank for someone's favor; to be grateful for someone's kindness.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠲᠠᠨ ᠳ᠋‍‍ᠤ‍ᠷ ᠶᠡᠺᠡ ᠲᠠᠯᠠᠷᠬᠠᠵᠤ ᠠᠮᠤᠢ</unicode>
          <transcript>tan dur jeke --zu amui</transcript>
          <definition> I am very grateful to you.</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
    </entry_item>
